; Fixing the motor screws
M291 R"Fixing the motor screws" P"Please lower the bed down to the extreme point and tighten the z screws of the motors" S4 K{"Test","Skip","Cancel"}
if input == 1
    M99
if input == 2
    abort "Test cancelled by user"
elif input == 0
    M564 H0 S0 Z
    M84 Z

M291 R"True Bed Leveling Test" P"Tilt the bed manually to test the True Bed Leveling." S4 K{"Test","Skip","Cancel"}
if input == 1
    M99
elif input == 2
    abort "Test cancelled by user"

M913 Z80 ; Reduce Z-axis current for safe manual movement
M564 H0 S0 Z
G91

M291 R"Fixing the motor screws" P"Lower the build plate and hold the Z motors from below while tightening the mounting screws." S4 K{"Screws Tightened","Cancel"} Z1
if input == 1
    abort "Test cancelled by user"

M913 Z100 ; Reset Z-axis current to 100%
M564 H1 S1
G90
M84